      <div class="mt-064">
        <h2>About Coforge</h2>
        <p class="mt-032">
          Coforge is an AI-native engineering services leader, where AI is the very
          foundation of how we design, build, and deliver intelligent solutions for
          our clients. We use AI and hyperspecialized industry expertise to engineer
          autonomous enterprises. We combine AI agents with our AI-enabled workforce,
          including specialized FDEs in hybrid pod-based delivery units. With a deep
          focus on trusted AI, our solutions are secure, governed, and
          enterprise-grade. We are outcome-led by design. Moving beyond AI
          experimentation, we deliver measurable business outcomes – lower operating
          costs, faster cycle times, higher conversion rates, and sustained margin
          growth.
        </p>
      </div>
      

      
